  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "JOE"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JOE",
   "text": "Okay, so listen. Plato's like, there's the real world, and there's the shadow world.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep09/v06.wav",
   "d": 5.875,
   "e": "00qwzwxwvg000wywwsfxqqztzvnttrvwutu20000"
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "EARL"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "EARL",
   "text": "I'm gonna stop you right there, man. I seen shadows. They exist.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep09/v08.wav",
   "d": 4.225,
   "e": "00xxzylzlyzuxyxuu6wmyyuzvtmbxwjxli000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JOE",
   "text": "No, no, the idea is... like... you think you're a cowboy, right? But what if \"cowboy\" is just a pattern.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep09/v09.wav",
   "d": 7.025,
   "e": "00yzzwxuxprru20syvqyvwk00xzlvyvtvqut3000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "EARL",
   "text": "Cowboy is a job.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep09/v10.wav",
   "d": 1.8,
   "e": "000003tzttzzzymsrfpwyurmjb40000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JOE",
   "text": "Right, but like... what is a job, truly?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep09/v11.wav",
   "d": 3.375,
   "e": "0000ayyrwvyyq9000hzyxpzzyujvsvsl90000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "The expert takes the cowboy apart. The hat is not the cowboy. The boots are not the cowboy. The truck is not the cowboy.",
   "see": [
    "a cowboy hat on a fence post",
    "a pair of boots",
    "a pickup truck"
   ],
   "mood": "playful and comic",
   "wav": "pilot/ep09/v12.wav",
